{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["北國必遭審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以法蓮酒徒引以為榮的華冠有禍了！",{"text":"它座落在醉酒者肥美的山谷頂上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它的榮美如將殘之花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，主有一位強壯有力的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像冰雹和帶來毀滅的暴風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像洶湧氾濫的洪水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必把華冠摔在地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮酒徒引以為榮的華冠必被踐踏在腳下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那榮美的將殘之花在肥沃的山谷之巔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它必像夏季到來之前早熟的無花果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人一看見它就把它摘下吞掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，萬軍之耶和華必作祂餘民的榮冠和華冕，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必使審判官公正斷案，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜力量給守城退敵之人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但祭司和先知也因醉酒而搖搖晃晃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因烈酒而東倒西歪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們因烈酒而搖搖晃晃、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"酩酊大醉，東倒西歪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們錯解異象，糊塗判案。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桌子上到處都是嘔吐之物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一片狼藉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們抱怨說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「祂想教導誰知識呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂想把信息解釋給誰呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是剛剛斷奶、離開母懷的嬰孩嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂的教導只是命命令令、命命令令、律律例例、律律例例、這裡一點、那裡一點。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"因此，耶和華必用外族人的口和陌生的語言來教訓他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華曾對他們說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「這是安歇之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓疲乏的人安歇吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是安歇之地。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻不肯聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，對他們來說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的話成了命命令令、命命令令、律律例例、律律例例、這裡一點、那裡一點，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他們走路時仰面跌倒，摔傷，落網，被捉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你們這些好譏諷、在耶路撒冷統管百姓的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽耶和華的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我們已經和死亡立約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與陰間結盟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勢不可擋的災難席捲而來時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們會安然無恙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們以謊言為庇護所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以詭詐為藏身處。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我要在錫安放一塊基石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一塊經過考驗的石頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一塊根基穩固的寶貴房角石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"信靠的人必不會恐慌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以公平為準繩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公義作線錘。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冰雹必砸碎你們虛謊的庇護所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洪水必淹沒你們的藏身處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們和死亡所立的約必被廢棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與陰間的結盟必不能長久。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勢不可擋的災難席捲而來時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必遭踐踏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災難必不分晝夜、日復一日地襲來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每次襲來都必擄掠你們。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白這信息的人都必驚恐萬分。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的床太小，不能舒身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的被子太窄，不足裹身。","poem":1},{"noteId":14}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必像在毗拉心山一樣挺身而出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在基遍谷一樣發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要完成祂奇異的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成就祂不尋常的工作。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在你們不要再譏諷了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以免你們的捆索更沉重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我已從主——萬軍之耶和華那裡聽到毀滅全國的諭旨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要側耳聽我的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"留心聽我的話語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道農夫會一直耕地而不撒種嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道他會一直犁地、耙地嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他整平土地之後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不種小茴香、大茴香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按行種小麥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在合適的地方種大麥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在田邊種粗麥嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他的上帝指點他，教導他耕種之道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"打小茴香不用大槌，用木棍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打大茴香不用石磙，用木棒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做餅的糧食要磨碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有人會不停地在場上碾壓糧食。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"馬拉著石磙在場上軋過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不會把糧食磨碎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些知識都是萬軍之耶和華所賜的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂有奇妙的謀略和偉大的智慧。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"此處的床和被子象徵他們虛假的安全感。","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}